{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-fb98b43e1f58008ae3d6","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"부스럭거리는 소리와 함께 한 약충이 구석에서 기어 나왔다","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["4497606065928413946"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-49ec12ec137545e9c595","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"내 단잠을 방해하는 게 누구냐……","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9585337531358715584"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-fa26661224626963b54f","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"또 손님을 접대해야겠군. 일단 내 더듬이부터 정리 좀 하고, 징……","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10264252762004582255"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f22d249638d7ff64fc87","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"징징——이렇게 오랜 시간이 흘렀는데도 탐색의 길을 가려는 사람이 있다니……","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15044535316782119685"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f62bd2951c4fc7ab3290","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"일단 내 질문에 대답해라, 젊은이. 분쟁의 검봉 아래에서 창을 든 왕을 따르는 용사는 얼마나 되지?","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["626601168001215207"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-37a1c2d4da23dba1c710","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"4명","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5889324135516235466","7228321106946573180"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-05d83408239f4d734c33","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"…맞아. 영광이 너와 함께하길, 징","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10565263012450479591","8647126431946117253"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-6cbe1b0b7df38df071d4","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"6명","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10159777000529155611","3623312432299467312"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-4556195c9e224ec52915","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"낙담하지 말게, 젊은이. 자세히 관찰해 봐——답은 햇빛이 비치지 않는 곳에 숨겨져 있어","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13918392607686002391","14647123643906514112"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-479d570b7b80d5f233a4","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"젊은이, 답은 생각했나? 분쟁의 검봉 아래에서 창을 든 왕을 따르는 용사는 얼마나 되지?","speaker":"영야의 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10551968399825099473"],"speakerHashCandidates":["11948679957739471545"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-22e2312b6ca75545b576","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s4dfa51db78a72e73","text":"9명","speaker":"","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 83","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1450386505